        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Dysphagia"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "About 6–8 weeks; mainly solids such as meat and bread, more than liquids. Feels as if food sticks halfway, at the mid sternum. Now happening most days. Needs to sip water to get food down and sometimes has to stop and wait."
      }
    },
